# Title: Suspicious Child Process Of BgInfo.EXE
# ID: 811f459f-9231-45d4-959a-0266c6311987
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2023-08-16
# Tags: attack.execution, attack.stealth, attack.t1059.005, attack.t1218, attack.t1202
# Description: Detects suspicious child processes of "BgInfo.exe" which could be a sign of potential abuse of the binary to proxy execution via external VBScript
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((((process_name:*\\calc.exe OR process_name:*\\cmd.exe OR process_name:*\\cscript.exe OR process_name:*\\mshta.exe OR process_name:*\\notepad.exe OR process_name:*\\powershell.exe OR process_name:*\\pwsh.exe OR process_name:*\\wscript.exe)) OR ((process_name:*\\AppData\\Local\\* OR process_name:*\\AppData\\Roaming\\* OR process_name:*:\\Users\\Public\\* OR process_name:*:\\Temp\\* OR process_name:*:\\Windows\\Temp\\* OR process_name:*:\\PerfLogs\\*))) AND ((parent_name:*\\bginfo.exe OR parent_name:*\\bginfo64.exe)))
